{"seq":1,"slug":"composable-architecture","title":"可组合架构（TCA / Composable Architecture）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/composable-architecture","wordCount":1095,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"可组合架构-tca-composable-architecture\">可组合架构（TCA / Composable Architecture）</h1><p>Point-Free 团队（Brandon Williams 与 Stephen Celis）在 2020 年发布的 The Composable Architecture（TCA）将函数式编程中的代数组合思想带入了 SwiftUI 应用开发。截至 2026 年 5 月，TCA 稳定版本为 1.18.x，已全面适配 Swift 6 严格并发模型（Sendable、@MainActor、region-based isolation），并通过 <code>@Reducer</code> 宏将样板代码量减少约 40%。TCA 不仅是一个 iOS 库——它代表的&quot;可组合 Reducer&quot;设计理念已经影响了 Android（Decompose、Ballast）和 KMP 生态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Reducer 代数组合</strong>：大 Feature 由小 Feature 通过 <code>Scope</code> 编译期安全组合，每个子 Reducer 拥有独立的 State/Action/Effect</li>\n<li><strong>Effect 系统</strong>：副作用被类型化为 <code>Effect&lt;Action&gt;</code>，支持取消、去重、与 Swift 并发模型集成</li>\n<li><strong>穷举式测试</strong>：<code>TestStore</code> 强制断言每一步状态变化和每一个 Effect 产生的 Action，遗漏即失败</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心代数结构\">核心代数结构</h2><p>TCA 的本质是将应用视为一组可组合的 <strong>Reducer 代数结构</strong>。每个 Feature 定义三要素：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Reducer</mtext><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>inout </mtext><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Reducer}: (\\text{inout } State, Action) \\rightarrow Effect\\langle Action \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Reducer</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">inout </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>State</strong>：一个 <code>struct</code>，描述 Feature 的完整屏幕状态</li>\n<li><strong>Action</strong>：一个 <code>enum</code>，枚举所有可能的用户操作和系统事件</li>\n<li><strong>Reducer</strong>：一个纯函数（<code>body</code> 属性），接收当前 State + Action，返回新 State + 可选 Effect</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@Reducer&#10;struct CounterFeature {&#10;    @ObservableState&#10;    struct State: Equatable, Sendable {&#10;        var count = 0&#10;        var isTimerRunning = false&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    enum Action: Sendable {&#10;        case increment&#10;        case decrement&#10;        case toggleTimer&#10;        case timerTick&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    var body: some ReducerOf&lt;Self&gt; {&#10;        Reduce { state, action in&#10;            switch action {&#10;            case .increment:&#10;                state.count += 1&#10;                return .none&#10;            case .decrement:&#10;                state.count -= 1&#10;                return .none&#10;            case .toggleTimer:&#10;                state.isTimerRunning.toggle()&#10;                return state.isTimerRunning&#10;                    ? .run { send in&#10;                        for await _ in Timer.publish(every: 1, on: .main, in: .common).autoconnect().values {&#10;                            await send(.timerTick)&#10;                        }&#10;                    }.cancellable(id: &quot;timer&quot;)&#10;                    : .cancel(id: &quot;timer&quot;)&#10;            case .timerTick:&#10;                state.count += 1&#10;                return .none&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Reducer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CounterFeature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @ObservableState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Equatable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sendable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isTimerRunning </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sendable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> increment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> decrement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> toggleTimer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> timerTick</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ReducerOf&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { state, action </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> action {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .increment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                state.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .decrement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                state.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .toggleTimer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                state.isTimerRunning.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">toggle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state.isTimerRunning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { send </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                        for</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> _</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Timer.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">every</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .main, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .common).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">autoconnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                            await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.timerTick)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    }.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cancellable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"timer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"timer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .timerTick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                state.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"组合-大-feature-由小-feature-拼成\">组合：大 Feature 由小 Feature 拼成</h2><p>TCA 的核心竞争力在&quot;Composable&quot;——通过 <code>Scope</code> 和 child reducer 嵌入，将大型页面拆分为独立可测的子 Feature，然后<strong>编译期保证</strong>它们正确组合：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    App[AppReducer] --&gt; Tab[TabReducer]&#10;    Tab --&gt; Home[HomeFeature]&#10;    Tab --&gt; Search[SearchFeature]&#10;    Tab --&gt; Profile[ProfileFeature]&#10;    Home --&gt; Banner[BannerFeature]&#10;    Home --&gt; ProductList[ProductListFeature]&#10;    ProductList --&gt; ProductRow[ProductRowFeature]\">graph TD\n    App[AppReducer] --&gt; Tab[TabReducer]\n    Tab --&gt; Home[HomeFeature]\n    Tab --&gt; Search[SearchFeature]\n    Tab --&gt; Profile[ProfileFeature]\n    Home --&gt; Banner[BannerFeature]\n    Home --&gt; ProductList[ProductListFeature]\n    ProductList --&gt; ProductRow[ProductRowFeature]</pre><p>每个叶子节点是一个独立 Reducer，拥有自己的 State/Action/Effect。父 Reducer 通过 <code>Scope</code> 将 Action 路由到子 Reducer：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@Reducer&#10;struct AppFeature {&#10;    struct State: Equatable {&#10;        var home = HomeFeature.State()&#10;        var search = SearchFeature.State()&#10;        var profile = ProfileFeature.State()&#10;        var selectedTab: Tab = .home&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    enum Action {&#10;        case home(HomeFeature.Action)&#10;        case search(SearchFeature.Action)&#10;        case profile(ProfileFeature.Action)&#10;        case tabSelected(Tab)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    var body: some ReducerOf&lt;Self&gt; {&#10;        Reduce { state, action in&#10;            switch action {&#10;            case .tabSelected(let tab):&#10;                state.selectedTab = tab&#10;                return .none&#10;            default:&#10;                return .none&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        Scope(state: \\.home, action: \\.home) { HomeFeature() }&#10;        Scope(state: \\.search, action: \\.search) { SearchFeature() }&#10;        Scope(state: \\.profile, action: \\.profile) { ProfileFeature() }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Reducer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppFeature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Equatable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> home </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HomeFeature.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SearchFeature.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProfileFeature.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#